Planning Commission
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
May 23, 2024
Chairman Caughey said that from the Planning Commission they all volunteer to serve because
they feel it is important to hear you and also balance the regulations. There are also private
property rights that developers have for what's allowable on their land and as long as they meet
those requirements that's the key. It's important to recognize that nobody wants to hurt our
community and we hear what you say. That is why your voice is incredibly important to be a
participant in that process so that all bodies can be heard. Thank you for your consideration and
comments today.
Adjournment
There being no further business the meeting was adjourned at 4:42 p.m.
